{"version":1,"content":"<p>2026 年國際足協東盟挑戰盃 (決賽)，今日傍晚在啟德主場館上演，香港隊以 2:0 擊敗柬埔寨。上半場 41 分鐘，安永佳接應孫銘謙的傳球，先入一球，領先上半場。下半場 54分鐘，陳肇鈞在禁區內被踢跌，球證判罰 12 碼，艾華頓射入，港隊將比數拉開，領先 2:0。下半場補時六分鐘，雙方再無入球，香港隊擊敗柬埔寨奪得「國際足協東盟盃」D2級別冠軍。現場有逾 3.1 萬球迷入場。國際足協會長恩芬天奴、文化體育及旅遊局局長羅淑佩等到場。</p>\n<p></p>\n\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-42-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-59-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-65-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-56-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-66-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-40-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-54-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://thecollectivehk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/20261003_AseanCup-35-1024x683.jpeg\" width=\"1024\"/></figure>\n<p></p>\n<figure><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"683\" loading=\"lazy\" 